@startuml refresh-sequence
!include _theme.puml
hide footbox
participant Console as C
participant API as A
database "Run store" as Q
participant Worker as W

C -> A : POST /api/jobs/refresh
A -> Q : Create refresh or\nreuse active run
A --> C : 202 + run ID
W -> Q : Claim refresh item
W -> W : Fetch and\nscreen\nlistings
W -> Q : Commit jobs and any\nchild indexing work
W -> Q : Checkpoint refresh
C -> A : GET /api/runs/{run_id}
A -> Q : Read run state
A --> C : Progress and child ID, if any
@enduml
